# The Grow Pot's compost: crumbs drawn over the pot's soil, one texture per charge of fertility.
# The soil under them is vanilla's own farmland or moist farmland (water); these say how much food
# is left. Nested: every crumb at 1 is there at 2, every crumb at 2 is there at 3, so the pile
# thins in place as plants eat it, the way the composter shows its level.
#
# Crumbs only inside the soil face the model maps (pixels 2-13); everything else is transparent.
# The palette is sampled from vanilla's composter_compost.png, olive vegetable bits included, and
# each crumb is a light top over a dark underside: the top is what reads on moist soil, the
# underside what reads on dry (a mid-brown top vanished into moist farmland in the first draft).

@palette default
. = none
d = 4A3018      compost, darkest
o = 524C10      vegetable matter
h = 8B5920
l = AC6520      catch-light

@texture block/grow_pot_compost_1 16x16 type=block
................
................
.....lh.....hh..
.....dd.....dd..
................
.........hh.....
.........dd.....
................
................
.....lh....lh...
......dd....dd..
................
................
................
................
................

